@startuml
title AI Chatbot — scoped inventory and expense assistance
autonumber

actor Owner
boundary "AI Chatbot View" as View
control "Store Context" as Store
control "Assistant API (/api/gemini)" as API
participant "Answer Builder\n(local chatbot helper)" as Local

== Prepare live context ==
activate Store
Store --> View: Current products, bales,\ncategories, accounts and expenses
deactivate Store
Owner -> View: Enter and send question
activate View
View -> View: Add user message to chat
View -> View: Check inventory/expense topic scope

alt Question is outside supported scope
  View -> View: Select out-of-scope reply
  View --> Owner: Display refusal message
else Question is in scope
  View -> API: POST prompt and live contextData
  activate API
  alt Assistant returns a non-fallback answer
    API --> View: Response text
    View -> View: Add assistant response to chat
  else Assistant returns fallback response
    API --> View: Fallback indicator
    View -> Local: Build fallback answer from live store data\nand the submitted question
    activate Local
    Local --> View: Inventory/expense summary
    deactivate Local
    View -> View: Add local answer to chat
  else API request fails
    API --> View: Error response
    View -> View: Log error and prepare unavailable message
  end
  deactivate API
  View --> Owner: Display assistant reply or error message
end
deactivate View
@enduml
